# Overture: what a first visit performs, about fifteen seconds, no model call.
# One short exchange played as it would stream (a question typed, a bar model
# drawn, a try written with the pen, a verdict), then the point in two lines
# and four things to tap. It sets no look of its own: it is drawn in whichever
# look the person has, with colour roles only, so paper and night both hold.
# The drawing is one group on a square canvas, so it fills a phone's width and
# a desktop's height alike, and every word sits in the group's own coordinates.

scene ask free calm align=center canvas=square
group g
rect in=g composer 4,12 92x14 r=7 stroke=dim thick=0.8 dur=0.6s
say in=g prompt at=50,19 enter=type | Help my 7-year-old with 64 ÷ 2
wait 0.4

say in=g total at=50,36 size=xl | 64
rect in=g whole 6,42 88x28 stroke=ink thick=1.2 dur=1.2s
line in=g cut 50,42 50,70 stroke=ink thick=1.2
say in=g q at=28,56 size=xxl ink=accent | ?
say in=g half at=72,56 size=xl | half
wait 0.8

drop q
path in=g three stroke=accent thick=3 dur=1s | M12 48 C23 43 29 51 20 55 C30 56 28 66 12 63
path in=g two stroke=accent thick=3 dur=0.9s | M31 50 C32 44 44 44 43 51 C42 56 37 59 31 64 H46
wait 0.3
say in=g yes at=50,85 size=xl enter=slam | Yes!
wait 0.8

scene point stack brisk lines=2 align=center
say size=l enter=fade dur=0.4s | Claude answers by drawing.
say size=l enter=fade dur=0.4s | You draw, tap or talk back.
wait 0.5
say choice size=l @13 enter=fade dur=0.3s | Teach my kid a maths problem
say choice size=l @13 enter=fade dur=0.3s | Explain how the heart pumps
say choice size=l @13 enter=fade dur=0.3s | Mock up an app screen
say choice size=l @13 enter=fade dur=0.3s | Build me a real webpage
